# One Netscape cookie-jar block per Gemini account. Add as many as you like;
# blocks are round-robin load-balanced (see README). DO NOT COMMIT real cookies:
# keep your live jars in `accounts.txt` (gitignored) and commit only this file.
#
# To export a jar: log in to https://gemini.google.com/app in your browser,
# then export cookies for google.com in Netscape HTTP Cookie File format
# (any cookie-export extension works). Each account needs `__Secure-1PSID`
# (plus `__Secure-1PSIDTS` if your account has it).

account 1:

```
# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# https://curl.haxx.se/rfc/cookie_spec.html
# This is a generated file! Do not edit.

.google.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	__Secure-1PSID	PASTE_ACCOUNT_1_SECURE_1PSID_HERE
.google.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	__Secure-1PSIDTS	PASTE_ACCOUNT_1_SECURE_1PSIDTS_HERE
```

account 2:

```
# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# https://curl.haxx.se/rfc/cookie_spec.html
# This is a generated file! Do not edit.

.google.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	__Secure-1PSID	PASTE_ACCOUNT_2_SECURE_1PSID_HERE
.google.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	0	__Secure-1PSIDTS	PASTE_ACCOUNT_2_SECURE_1PSIDTS_HERE
```
